      "description": "Es el umbral de FenrirMemoriaAlta. Reparto, no total: estas series suman por encima del panel del sistema (42,8 frente a 36,7 el 2026-09-10) porque las paginas compartidas cuentan en cada proceso. La cifra buena es la del appliance, a la izquierda. Y si el tmpfs esta lleno el problema real es el disco y no la memoria: la cache no drena al HDD y crece (T1 -> T7)."
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Frames sin analizar (fps) · la alerta mira la media de 10 min > 0,5",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "frigate_skipped_fps",
          "legendFormat": "{{camera_name}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "time_series"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "avg_over_time(frigate_skipped_fps[10m])",
          "legendFormat": "{{camera_name}} · media 10 min",
          "refId": "B",
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0,
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 2,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.5
              }
            ]
          },
          "custom": {
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "dashed"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*cam_01.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "blue"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*cam_02.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "purple"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*media 10 min.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.lineStyle",
                "value": {
                  "fill": "dash",
                  "dash": [
                    10,
                    10
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "description": "El tono dice la camara y el trazo discontinuo la media de 10 min, que es exactamente lo que evalua DetectorSaturado."
    },
